a(n) ||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Because of the new types of Karmas, the illusions will increase"},"pu":{"ss":"ਭਰਮ ਵਧ ਗਿਆ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ।"}}},{"verse_id":98373,"page_no":560,"line_no":98373,"gurmukhi":"ਸਭ ਜਗ ਪਾਪੀ ॥","translit_en":"sabh jag paapee ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਸਾਰਾ ਜਗਤ ਪਾਪੀ (ਹੋ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ)।"}}},{"verse_id":98374,"page_no":560,"line_no":98374,"gurmukhi":"ਕਹੂੰ ਨ ਜਾਪੀ ॥੯੧॥","translit_en":"kahoo(n) na jaapee ||91||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"The whole world will become sinful and no person repeating the Name or performing austerities, will be left in the world.91."},"pu":{"ss":"ਕੋਈ ਵੀ ਜਪ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ ॥੯੧॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9194,"next":9196}}